  <name>Haskell Toolchain Manager</name>
  <summary>Install GHC, Cabal, HLS and Stack</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Haskell Toolchain Manager is a GTK4/libadwaita application for installing
      and managing the Haskell toolchain. It downloads toolchains from the
      official GHCup release channels.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Install, set and remove versions of the GHC compiler</li>
      <li>Manage Cabal, Stack and the Haskell Language Server</li>
      <li>Follow the regular, prerelease and nightly release channels</li>
      <li>Configure metadata sources from the preferences dialog</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">org.haskell.GhcupGtk.desktop</launchable>
